WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.103
This demo uses an anime-style rooftop scene and a realistic-style race car
clip.

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:19.919
Check the timeline below to confirm that the rooftop clip comes first,
followed by the car clip.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.636
When playback reaches the car, the preview changes too, so you can review
both clips in sequence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.323
Review the sequence and format in the export window without starting a new
export.

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:54.651
Finally, review the information for the video already created, which
concludes this walkthrough.
